Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Fierce Battle against the Giant Beast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the description of the residents, the monster is in this direction
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.51,0:00:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it can only pass through this bridge when entering the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay a trap first to stop the monster from advancing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy used to be the best at digging holes when he was catching goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy is not here, I’m a bit unaccustomed to it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.77,0:01:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, be careful tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.82,0:01:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,what sound
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.10,0:01:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:01:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we were too nervous and heard wrongly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:01:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.40,0:02:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared me to death
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it will be very dangerous in the city tonight. What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we need to find Weslie quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.07,0:02:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nephew, it’s dangerous outside tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.95,0:02:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have arranged for the residents to hide in the palace. You don’t have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you can spend this evening safely
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.67,0:02:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your hard work, Uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,nephew
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good rest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched every room
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Only this room has never been searched
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:02:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In, in, in a word
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend won’t be here anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s look elsewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There should be some rooms that I haven’t found yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.26,0:03:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,are you there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.51,0:03:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is coming
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t fight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at my entanglement attack
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting. Stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.95,0:04:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t fight
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name is Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.46,0:04:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So what? Do you still want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The amount of information today is a bit overwhelming. Let me catch my breath for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s someone here named Weslie and there’s someone named Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then is there someone named Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do by breaking into the palace at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I came in here to find my friend Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.92,0:04:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not you Weslie of Bulala, it’s another one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, I didn’t destroy Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were looking for him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He has left the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too dangerous for him to be out there if he encounters a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,this monster
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t it the one that attacked me in the cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Successful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,not good
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster is coming
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.97,0:06:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do? The monster is going to eat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will save us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster is coming
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the residents have taken refuge in the palace, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who destroyed Bulala is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What? does he really want to stop the monster from destroying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it’s simply overestimating his abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He is fighting the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have to help him
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, the monster is very dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,His fangs and claws will scratch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s because of the danger that I went to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.74,0:07:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.74,0:07:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won’t let go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to help Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You also want to hinder me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t get me wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go with you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster is out there destroying our homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And as the prince of the Bulala people, how can I stand idly by?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If this continues, the city will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back to you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.26,0:08:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Try this trick
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Successful
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.29,0:09:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like the gloves I made for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Very suitable
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I found you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You still can’t do it without me, Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you become like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, ouch
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a long story
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.14,0:09:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,pull together
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,are you okay
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Wolffy, don’t fall down that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking. The monster is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did the monster go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are all people named Weslie so awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s your friends who are more powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you who saved us just now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My house was smashed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,OMG
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:12:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,my home is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.93,0:12:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I underestimated the monster
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
